//================================================================
// module Top
// Author: Neha Karanjkar
//
// The top-level module Sitar requires for `sitar compile` (it looks for
// a module literally named Top). Just instantiates Core -- kept as its
// own file rather than folded into Core.sitar so that Core stays a
// reusable submodule (e.g. for a future multi-core Top). Identical in
// shape to core_only's own Top.sitar.
//================================================================

module Top
	submodule core : Core
end module
